OL,5,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,6,     FTom Service with the perfect
OL,7,     Fclassical soundtrack for the
OL,8,     Fweekend! Conductor Dinis Sousa
OL,9,     Fchats about his musical life -
OL,10,     Ffrom studying film to falling in
OL,11,     Flove with conducting.
OL,12,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,13,     FJools is joined by the actress
OL,14,     FRachael Stirling.
OL,15,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,16,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,17,     FMusic. 1828, Vienna. Virtuoso
OL,18,     Fviolinist Paganini arrives in the
OL,19,     FAustrian capital and sparks a
OL,20,     Fcraze that spreads across Europe.
