OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,7,     Fclassical releases, joined by
OL,8,     FNigel Simeone and pianist Kathryn
OL,9,     FStott, who surveys Beethoven's
OL,10,     F'Spring' Sonata and makes a top
OL,11,     Fchoice.
OL,12,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,13,     FEdith Bowman presents a curated
OL,14,     Fmix of film scores and
OL,15,     Fsoundtracks. This week, Edith
OL,16,     Fspeaks to Harry Gregson-Williams
OL,17,     Fabout his latest score to Ridley
OL,18,     FScott's The Dog Stars.
