OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam is joined by American
OL,7,     Fpianist, activist, and broadcaster
OL,8,     FLara Downes, for a listening
OL,9,     Fparty, including music by Florence
OL,10,     FPrice, Stevie Wonder, and Philip
OL,11,     FGlass.
OL,12,G1800 Opera on 3: Elektra
OL,13,     FGreek tragedy meets modern
OL,14,     Fpsychology in Richard Strauss's
OL,15,     Faudacious opera, conducted by
OL,16,     FKarina Canellakis and performed by
OL,17,     Fthe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,18,     FOrchestra in Edinburgh.
