OL,5,G2230 New Music Show
OL,6,     FTom Service with a new work by
OL,7,     FCassie Kinoshi, performed by the
OL,8,     FManchester Collective at Leeds'
OL,9,     FHoward Assembly Room in June. Plus
OL,10,     Fhighlights from the Young Composer
OL,11,     FProm.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FBaritone Mihai Damian stars in
OL,14,     FMussorgsky's Songs and Dances of
OL,15,     FDeath. The concert also features
OL,16,     FRimsky-Korsakov's Suite from 'The
OL,17,     FTale of Tsar Saltan'.
